							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">PS - from the site....<br /><br />We are looking for submissions for blog entries about the artists, albums, songs and people on Amie Street.<br /><br />Submit your reviews, essays, digital photos, art, creative works, musings, thoughts and opinions to editor [at] amiestreet.com<br /><br />If you have your own music blog, we&#039;d love to syndicate your posts about Amie Street artists too.<br /><br /></td>
