						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><a href="http&#58;//seattletimes.nwsource.com/html/musicnightlife/2003829006_nite10.html" target="_blank">http://seattletimes.nwsource.com/html/musicnightlife/2003829006_nite10.html</a><br /><br />It&#039;s interesting how the press tries to connect the local groups with the club nights like Tabella. They seem like totally different scenes? <br /><br />It&#039;s great&nbsp; they printed DeVon&#039;s response. All props to him for getting his perspective in there. <br /><br /></td>
